-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §42 ותק למענק יובל: from the June 2012
-- salary, the accumulated teaching seniority a jubilee grant asks under §8
-- of the collective agreement of 31.8.94 is 25 years, in place of the 30
-- that section sets; the grant's other rules are unchanged.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`

§ `42 ותק למענק יובל`

§§ `42(א)`

-- (א): from the salary of June 2012 (convention dates.salary-month), the
-- accumulated seniority in teaching required for the jubilee grant of §8 of
-- the collective agreement of 31.8.94 is 25 years, "במקום 30 שנה כמפורט
-- בסעיף האמור". Before that salary §42 sets nothing: the 30 years are
-- §8's (quoted here, not yet encoded). Years are whole years completed
-- (convention thresholds.seniority). Part י speaks of every teaching
-- employee (§4(א)), on the reform's terms or not.
@ref akn:art_42__para_a
`the first salary month of section 42` MEANS `the Oz salary month` 2012 6

`the jubilee seniority section 42 sets` MEANS 25

`the jubilee seniority section 8 of the agreement of 31.8.94 sets, as section 42 quotes it` MEANS 30

GIVEN `the salary month` IS A NUMBER @desc as `the Oz salary month` counts it
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the jubilee seniority section 42 requires in` `the salary month` IS
    IF `the salary month` AT LEAST `the first salary month of section 42`
    THEN JUST `the jubilee seniority section 42 sets`
    ELSE NOTHING

GIVEN `the salary month` IS A NUMBER
      `whole years of accumulated teaching seniority` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `has the jubilee seniority under section 42 in` `the salary month` `whole years of accumulated teaching seniority` IF
    CONSIDER `the jubilee seniority section 42 requires in` `the salary month`
    WHEN JUST years THEN `whole years of accumulated teaching seniority` AT LEAST years
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE

§§ `42(ב)`

-- (ב): the agreement does not change the other rules that apply to the
-- jubilee grant: its amount, when it is paid and how a part-time position
-- counts are §8's.
@ref akn:art_42__para_b
`why the jubilee grant's other rules are not here` MEANS
    `not yet encoded` "סעיף 8 להסכם הקיבוצי מיום 31.8.94 (ארגון המורים), מענק יובל"

§§ `42 -- illustrations`

#ASSERT `the jubilee seniority section 42 requires in` (`the Oz salary month` 2012 6) EQUALS JUST 25
#ASSERT `the jubilee seniority section 42 requires in` (`the Oz salary month` 2012 5) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `has the jubilee seniority under section 42 in` (`the Oz salary month` 2013 6) 25
#ASSERT NOT `has the jubilee seniority under section 42 in` (`the Oz salary month` 2013 6) 24
-- five years fewer than the 30 the section replaces
#ASSERT `the jubilee seniority section 8 of the agreement of 31.8.94 sets, as section 42 quotes it` MINUS `the jubilee seniority section 42 sets` EQUALS 5
